abstract: >-
  An independent AI-assisted scientific research case study in frontier discovery,
  prior-art attack, hypothesis competition, preregistration, frozen analysis software,
  synthetic adversarial validation, and evidence-gated stopping. The physical mechanism
  remained unresolved because the required external raw trajectory data were not obtained.
